      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BORROWED TIMES (8) goes very well this trip starting eight times for four wins and two minors. Below best last time at Maitland (25.34) in a Grade 5, finishing a 4.5 lengths fifth. Rates a leading player. LOOKS A TREAT (2) did a good job to finish third last time out over 400m at Maitland (22.67) in a Grade 5, the second top-three finish on the trot. Can improve sharply here. MINISTRY (1) was strong over this course and distance last time despite filling the minors, finishing half a length behind Tara Rebel in 22.71 and recording a new PB here. Expected to feature again. DIESEL DASH (3) is a last-start placegetter at this track and distance - in the mix again.",
